  - m_Id: 41582931045507553
    m_Localized: 내버려 둔다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507554
    m_Localized: 총을 꺼내든다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507555
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 아직 때가 아니야.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507556
    m_Localized: 쏴버린다
    m_Metadata:
