    m_Localized: 이야기를 들어본다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507558
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507559
    m_Localized: 쏴버린다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507560
    m_Localized: 이야기를 들어본다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507561
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 그러면 안 되지.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507562
    m_Localized: 쏴버린다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507563
    m_Localized: 이야기를 들어본다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507564
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507565
    m_Localized: 쏴버린다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507566
    m_Localized: 이야기를 들어본다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507567
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 안 그러는 게 좋을 텐데.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507568
    m_Localized: 쏴버린다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507569
    m_Localized: 이야기를 들어본다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507570
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507571
    m_Localized: 쏴버린다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507572
    m_Localized: 이야기를 들어본다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507573
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 왜 이런 검사를 해대면서 스스로를 괴롭히는 거지?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507574
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 때가 오면 떠날 준비만 하면 되거늘.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507575
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 대체 뭘 그렇게 기다리는 건지 원.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507576
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 할 말이 없군.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507577
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507578
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507579
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 사진을 찍어본 지 아주 오래됐어.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507580
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507581
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 네 행동에 대해 책임을 지게 될 거다.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507582
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 실수하는 거라고.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507583
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 두려워할 필요 없어. 우리는 모두 더 나은 삶을 향해 나아갈 테니까. 우리는 구원받을 거야.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507584
    m_Localized: 치아
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507585
    m_Localized: 손
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507586
    m_Localized: 눈
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507587
    m_Localized: 겨드랑이
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507588
    m_Localized: 사진
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507589
    m_Localized: 귀
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507590
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 그래, 물론이지.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507591
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 조금 틀어졌고... 아무래도 다른 사람들에 비해 약간 큰 듯싶은데.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507592
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507593
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507594
    m_Localized: 내버려 둔다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507595
    m_Localized: 총을 꺼내든다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507596
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507597
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507598
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 그래... 우리는 고난으로 가득한 삶을 살고 있지.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507599
    m_Localized: 내버려 둔다
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507600
